# Personal training data — never commit this.
#
# A Fitbod export is a detailed record of when you trained, how strong you were
# and when you stopped: timestamped sets with exact weights. The app itself
# needs none of it in the repo (logged data lives in IndexedDB on the device),
# and the test suite needs only the exercise names, which are checked in as
# tests/fitbod-exercise-names.txt instead.
fitbod_export.csv
*-export.csv

